"A red player with a green health bar fires red projectiles toward blue enemies on a tiled SVG field.","https://action-with-ai.mizchi.workers.dev/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)","items",[79],"Roo Code","links","Creator evidence",[85],"evidence","section",{"_56":86,"_25":87,"_88":89},"Read the original AI development account","https://zenn.dev/mizchi/articles/game-with-cline","note","The author names Roo Code and Claude 3.5 Sonnet, explains the no-direct-coding constraint and documents the human design and steering role.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[94],{"_56":95,"_25":96,"_88":97},"Open the complete action prototype","https://github.com/mizchi/action-with-ai","Complete React/TypeScript project with SVG rendering, movement, collision, combat, shared types, tests and development notes. No repository license file was found in the reviewed tree.","Access type","playable","demo","Play or run",[103],{"_56":104,"_25":67,"_88":105},"Play Action with AI","Early desktop keyboard-and-mouse prototype. WASD moves and holding the mouse button fires; visual polish and a full commercial campaign are outside its scope.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","build log","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[113],{"_56":114,"_25":87,"_88":-7},"Read the creator’s Roo Code experiment","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[119,120,121,122],"Move with WASD, aim with the mouse and hold the mouse button to shoot.","Read the original sequence from rendering and movement through enemy health and attack warnings.","Inspect docs/overview.md, the shared types and combat modules alongside the creator’s discussion of documentation drift.","For local study, install the project dependencies with the documented pnpm setup and run pnpm dev, then change one attack or movement rule.","AI workflow / foundation context","Mizchi explicitly used Roo Code, formerly Roo Cline, with Claude 3.5 Sonnet while forbidding direct human code edits. The human supplied an experienced developer’s design, incremental instructions and architecture constraints. The published article includes the workflow and limitations; this is an early prototype.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","2D","track","metadata","Engine","React · SVG · TypeScript","engine","lead","2d",[119,120,121,122],{"_56":114,"_25":87,"_17":150},{"_56":104,"_25":67,"_17":99,"_88":105},{"_56":95,"_25":96,"_88":97,"_148":149},{"_56":86,"_25":87,"_88":89},"ai-assisted","resourceIds",[],"scope","complete-project","build-log",{"_152":153},"documents",{"_154":155,"_156":157},"en",[159,163,164,165,162,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,161,198,160,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216],"zh",[158,159,160,161,162],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-desig